WEBVTT

00:01.567 --> 00:03.087
<i>Do you know the legend?</i>

00:03.087 --> 00:04.987
<i>I heard something wild about payphones.</i>

00:04.987 --> 00:07.587
<i>If you answer the call, 
you'll be taken to paradise.</i>

00:07.587 --> 00:08.717
<i>For real?</i>

00:09.497 --> 00:11.667
<i>Payphones are such a vibe.</i>

00:12.087 --> 00:13.867
<i>Do they still have those?</i>

00:14.497 --> 00:16.997
<i>I learned how to use them in grade school.</i>

00:16.997 --> 00:19.507
<i>I saw that on TV. 
People have already disappeared.</i>

01:58.267 --> 02:03.277
<b>Episode 1  Urban Legend</b>

02:01.237 --> 02:03.007
Are you okay, Hando-san?

02:03.007 --> 02:05.057
Hang in there!

02:05.057 --> 02:07.047
Who <i>is</i> this shrimp?

02:07.047 --> 02:08.197
Who're you calling a shrimp?

02:08.867 --> 02:12.457
I'm Yoshina Ageha of Shira High class 1-C.

02:12.457 --> 02:17.967
I came to teach that gorilla a lesson 
for extorting our students.

02:17.967 --> 02:19.717
Mission complete.

02:19.717 --> 02:21.787
How'd the bad guy hunt go?

02:21.787 --> 02:23.847
Ageha won again.

02:23.847 --> 02:27.767
He really can fix anything 
for ten thousand yen.

02:27.767 --> 02:33.857
He sure loves going out of his way 
to find trouble, though.

02:35.047 --> 02:38.677
He just wants a reason to go wild.

02:39.947 --> 02:42.417
Man, I'm bored.

02:43.287 --> 02:48.937
<i>I heard online that 
our planet is done for.</i>

02:49.787 --> 02:54.177
<i>The toxic gases we released 
are making the Earth too hot,</i>

02:54.177 --> 02:56.387
<i>and it'll kill all of us someday.</i>

02:56.787 --> 02:59.397
<i>We can't get rid of 
nuclear weapons or wars,</i>

02:59.397 --> 03:02.767
<i>and Japan will be destroyed 
when it's dragged into one.</i>

03:02.767 --> 03:07.137
<i>We'll run out of oil in 30 years, 
putting us in an energy crisis.</i>

03:07.437 --> 03:10.467
Hey! I'm done, Saka and Hiro.

03:10.757 --> 03:14.757
<i>Anonymous online abuse 
is racking up a real-life body count.</i>

03:14.757 --> 03:17.667
<i>We may or may not 
be able to receive pensions.</i>

03:17.667 --> 03:18.357
<i>But...</i>

03:18.357 --> 03:21.277
I don't give a shit.

03:21.277 --> 03:23.677
About what, Yoshina-kun?

03:23.677 --> 03:28.197
None of your business. I'm just 
thinking really hard about my life.

03:28.197 --> 03:32.027
You should think about studying before 
you think about anything else, Ageha.

03:33.107 --> 03:34.827
Aren't you the grownup, Hiroki?

03:35.517 --> 03:38.937
<i>Whatever. Who cares about my future?</i>

03:38.937 --> 03:41.007
<i>I only care about living in the present.</i>

03:42.087 --> 03:43.297
Crap!

03:43.297 --> 03:47.217
I'd better get home soon, 
or my sister will smack me again.

03:52.397 --> 03:54.457
Is that payphone ringing?

03:55.247 --> 03:56.577
Scary!

03:56.577 --> 03:58.397
Is it a wrong number?

03:58.997 --> 04:00.887
Should I answer?

04:02.157 --> 04:03.397
Guess I am.

04:05.087 --> 04:07.357
Hello, who's calling?

04:14.867 --> 04:15.747
Who are you?

04:18.747 --> 04:23.377
I-It vanished? What was that?

04:28.137 --> 04:31.467
Is this... a telephone card?

04:31.837 --> 04:34.477
P... P-sy-ren?

04:37.647 --> 04:41.747
Hey! You look worn out, Ageha.

04:42.147 --> 04:45.907
My sister lectured me for three hours 
for being three minutes over curfew.

04:45.907 --> 04:48.077
My life couldn't be more inefficient.

04:48.077 --> 04:51.857
Your big sis is pretty, 
but she's scary, too.

04:51.857 --> 04:54.797
Did she find out about yesterday's fight?

04:54.797 --> 04:57.037
Like I'd tell her, dumbass! She'd kill me!

04:58.917 --> 05:01.007
Man, I'm bored.

05:01.007 --> 05:05.147
Maybe yesterday's guys will come 
looking for revenge with their buddies.

05:05.147 --> 05:08.007
I even told them my school and class.

05:08.007 --> 05:10.617
Now you're just asking for trouble.

05:11.397 --> 05:12.967
Hey, it's the Ice Queen.

05:13.327 --> 05:15.307
She actually came to school today.

05:19.067 --> 05:23.937
<i>Her name is Amamiya Sakurako. 
Her nickname is the Ice Queen.</i>

05:24.337 --> 05:27.087
<i>Amamiya doesn't have friends.</i>

05:27.087 --> 05:31.387
<i>Almost nobody in our class 
has even spoken to her.</i>

05:31.887 --> 05:35.697
<i>It all dates back to the start of April, 
when we'd just entered high school...</i>

05:36.247 --> 05:41.287
<i>and what Amamiya said to a pair 
of girls who'd approached her.</i>

05:41.547 --> 05:43.737
Psyren is coming.

05:43.737 --> 05:47.737
And when it does, we'll all be 
powerless worms before it.

05:47.737 --> 05:48.977
We'll all die.

05:48.977 --> 05:50.837
You know nothing.

05:51.107 --> 05:52.877
But maybe ignorance is bliss.

05:52.877 --> 05:56.487
Until then, enjoy your 
meaningless teenage years.

05:57.927 --> 06:01.897
<i>That was how Amamiya Sakurako 
became untouchable—</i>

06:01.897 --> 06:04.567
<i>a super-cool nonconformist.</i>

06:04.567 --> 06:08.167
<i>And first impressions last.</i>

06:09.347 --> 06:10.997
<i>But I remember...</i>

06:12.457 --> 06:18.537
<i>When we were classmates as kids, 
Amamiya was cheerful, smart, and popular.</i>

06:18.927 --> 06:23.877
<i>She kindly cheered me up when 
I was a mess over my mom's death.</i>

06:26.627 --> 06:28.797
Who does she think she is?

06:28.797 --> 06:30.237
Right?

06:42.187 --> 06:46.937
<b>Shirataki High School Student ID</b>

06:42.187 --> 06:46.937
<b>General Education, Class 1-C</b>

06:42.587 --> 06:44.537
This is Amamiya's.

06:47.277 --> 06:49.177
This telephone card...

06:55.507 --> 06:57.717
Amamiya, isn't this yours?

06:59.857 --> 07:03.267
Seriously? You could at least thank me.

07:03.707 --> 07:06.627
Your wallet was, uh...

07:06.957 --> 07:09.667
I know. This happens all the time.

07:09.667 --> 07:10.567
Thank you.

07:12.877 --> 07:17.757
Oh, right. How do you pronounce 
that word on your red telephone card?

07:18.247 --> 07:19.347
Telephone card?

07:19.347 --> 07:21.437
What are you talking about?

07:21.437 --> 07:23.267
I don't have a red telephone card.

07:23.607 --> 07:25.977
Don't play games with me, Yoshina Ageha.

07:25.977 --> 07:29.877
Just listen. There are lots of things 
you're better off not knowing.

07:30.297 --> 07:32.107
If you dig too deeply out of curiosity...

07:32.987 --> 07:34.337
Why now?

07:35.777 --> 07:37.707
Hey, where are you going?

07:38.327 --> 07:39.537
Don't follow me.

07:39.987 --> 07:42.937
If you're in trouble, let me know.

07:42.937 --> 07:45.247
My counseling fee's 
ten thousand yen per hour.

07:47.117 --> 07:49.837
Then help me.

07:52.017 --> 07:52.967
Amamiya?

08:00.927 --> 08:05.137
<i>Amamiya Sakurako went missing 
the very next day.</i>

08:06.387 --> 08:09.477
<i>There were all kinds of rumors about her.</i>

08:09.817 --> 08:12.117
<i>About her parents falling into a cult,</i>

08:12.117 --> 08:16.637
<i>domestic violence, yakuza 
debt collectors, et cetera.</i>

08:16.637 --> 08:18.817
<i>People spread all kinds of crap.</i>

08:20.737 --> 08:23.647
<i>I wonder where Amamiya is now.</i>

08:24.787 --> 08:27.457
"Psyren is coming," huh?

08:30.457 --> 08:32.237
What did you just say?

08:32.237 --> 08:33.837
What does Psyren mean?

08:35.397 --> 08:39.677
That's what Amamiya said 
at the start of the year.

08:39.677 --> 08:41.257
You heard it, too.

08:41.577 --> 08:44.817
<i>That's it. That word's pronounced Psyren.</i>

08:45.477 --> 08:50.767
Could Psyren be the secret society 
from the urban legend?

08:50.767 --> 08:51.897
Secret society?

08:52.197 --> 08:55.037
It's big online right now.

08:55.037 --> 09:02.157
The secret society Psyren guides those 
who tire of reality to a new paradise.

09:02.157 --> 09:05.407
You've heard about the people going 
missing around the country, right?

09:05.407 --> 09:06.957
Mysterious disappearances?

09:06.957 --> 09:11.247
If you want to know more, 
why not ask the occult club?

09:11.247 --> 09:12.707
<b>Occult Club</b>

09:16.667 --> 09:21.017
I wouldn't go after Psyren 
if I were you, Yoshina-kun.

09:21.017 --> 09:23.007
An occult novice like you...

09:23.007 --> 09:24.217
would die!

09:24.667 --> 09:26.137
Tell me.

09:26.137 --> 09:30.137
I suppose I owe you 
for defeating that gorilla.

09:30.137 --> 09:34.377
Are you familiar with the missing persons 
cases that have been all over the news?

09:34.377 --> 09:35.687
Yeah, the mysterious disappearances.

09:35.687 --> 09:40.537
People living ordinary lives 
suddenly vanish one day.

09:40.537 --> 09:43.597
They have nothing in common.

09:43.597 --> 09:46.197
With no leads, the police are at a loss.

09:46.747 --> 09:50.657
But a rumor has started spreading online.

09:50.657 --> 09:54.417
A secret society called Psyren 
and its agent, Nemesis Q,

09:54.417 --> 09:57.387
are responsible for the disappearances!

09:57.387 --> 09:59.137
Nemesis Q?

09:59.467 --> 10:03.827
The mysterious and elusive 
Nemesis Q's true identity is unknown.

10:03.827 --> 10:06.677
The person appears and vanishes like smoke.

10:10.017 --> 10:13.337
Nemesis Q gives red telephone cards

10:13.337 --> 10:17.277
to those who seek paradise 
and leads them to Psyren.

10:17.277 --> 10:22.907
In fact, it's rumored that the people who 
disappeared had red telephone cards—

10:23.247 --> 10:27.867
and that they were taken away 
after using them.

10:30.337 --> 10:32.157
Yeah, right.

10:32.157 --> 10:34.797
Who uses telephone cards 
in this day and age?

10:34.797 --> 10:37.377
Sounds like your run-of-the-mill 
urban legend to me.

10:38.607 --> 10:42.837
This is where it gets really good. 
You see...

10:43.167 --> 10:45.717
They say someone's offering 
a 500-million-yen reward

10:45.717 --> 10:49.267
to anyone who uncovers 
the truth about Psyren!

10:49.267 --> 10:50.387
500 million?!

10:50.727 --> 10:53.997
It's a famous billionaire 
within the occult world.

10:53.997 --> 10:58.087
The reward sparked a sudden 
interest in solving the mystery.

10:58.087 --> 11:00.827
Occult fans, the media, yakuza...

11:00.827 --> 11:04.487
Everyone's caught up in the craze.

11:04.757 --> 11:10.037
You can find tons of Psyren cards 
listed in online auctions.

11:10.037 --> 11:12.747
Most are probably fake...

11:12.747 --> 11:18.127
but a real, unused card 
would go for five million.

11:18.127 --> 11:20.667
F-Five million?

11:21.647 --> 11:26.157
Like I said, it's best 
to leave Psyren alone.

11:26.157 --> 11:31.267
Someone operating a site investigating 
Psyren already ended up dead.

11:38.787 --> 11:39.887
Amamiya...

11:42.547 --> 11:44.517
Here's the windup...

11:44.517 --> 11:45.697
Wait, Sis!

11:48.497 --> 11:49.867
That hurt!

11:49.867 --> 11:53.997
A neighborhood lady saw you brawling.

11:53.997 --> 11:58.417
Didn't I say I'd kill you 
if you caused trouble for others?

11:58.687 --> 12:01.387
I wasn't causing trouble! 
I was helping someone!

12:01.387 --> 12:04.927
Shut up! Don't talk back to me, kid!

12:04.927 --> 12:07.727
You're in high school now, 
but you haven't changed a bit.

12:07.727 --> 12:10.217
Fighting, making mischief, 
staying out all night...

12:10.217 --> 12:13.387
What are you trying to do? 
What about your future?

12:13.707 --> 12:16.097
Mom would cry if she could see you now.

12:18.887 --> 12:23.277
Dad called earlier. 
He's worried about you.

12:23.277 --> 12:27.487
While Dad's away on business, 
I'm your guardian.

12:27.487 --> 12:31.397
You're grounded for fighting.

12:31.397 --> 12:33.777
Try and sneak out, and I'll kill you.

12:37.167 --> 12:38.657
Ow...

12:38.657 --> 12:40.667
Does she have to hit me so hard?

12:40.947 --> 12:43.417
What do you want to do with your future?

12:43.827 --> 12:45.737
I don't know.

12:46.127 --> 12:49.727
It's not like I'll have to worry 
about money anytime soon.

12:52.567 --> 12:55.147
How do online auctions work?

12:55.477 --> 12:58.687
<b>News</b>

12:55.477 --> 12:58.687
<b>Another Victim Goes Missing
in String of Disappearances</b>

12:58.687 --> 13:01.947
Nemesis Q gives red telephone cards

13:01.947 --> 13:05.767
to those who seek paradise 
and leads them to Psyren.

13:06.907 --> 13:08.817
Then help me.

13:22.377 --> 13:27.797
If I manage to help you, you owe me 
ten thousand yen, Amamiya.

13:30.637 --> 13:34.257
<i>Five million! 
Five million for an unused card!</i>

13:37.367 --> 13:41.057
I used it! I used it, Amamiya!

13:46.807 --> 13:50.357
<i>Good morning. Worlds will be connected.</i>

13:50.357 --> 13:52.497
<i>You've reached the Psyren 
Immigration Control Center.</i>

13:53.627 --> 13:56.507
<i>Your immigration interview 
will now commence.</i>

13:56.507 --> 13:58.407
<i>Please answer the following questions.</i>

13:59.407 --> 14:01.697
<i>The questions are multiple choice.</i>

14:02.387 --> 14:08.117
<i>Press one for yes and two for no.</i>

14:08.117 --> 14:11.657
<i>Question one: Are you a Japanese citizen 
twelve years of age or older?</i>

14:11.657 --> 14:12.757
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:12.757 --> 14:16.257
What the hell? Uh, one?

14:16.757 --> 14:20.197
<i>Question two: Do you have no hope 
for this country's future?</i>

14:20.197 --> 14:21.437
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:22.437 --> 14:26.137
<i>Question three: 
Have you ever suffered a brain injury</i>

14:26.137 --> 14:28.977
<i>or been diagnosed with a mental disorder?</i>

14:28.977 --> 14:30.147
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:32.287 --> 14:35.187
<i>Question four: Do you experience 
chronic respiratory distress</i>

14:35.187 --> 14:38.997
<i>or find it difficult to breathe 
this planet's air?</i>

14:38.997 --> 14:40.247
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:41.307 --> 14:45.037
<i>Question 12: Can you 
communicate without words?</i>

14:45.037 --> 14:46.417
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:47.567 --> 14:50.907
<i>Question 18: Have you shed blue blood?</i>

14:50.907 --> 14:52.247
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:53.137 --> 14:57.697
<i>Question 30: Have you killed 
a creature larger than a human?</i>

14:57.697 --> 14:59.017
<i>Yes or no.</i>

14:59.847 --> 15:04.027
<i>Question 60: Do you feel unfulfilled 
with your high school life?</i>

15:04.027 --> 15:05.477
<i>Yes or no.</i>

15:06.727 --> 15:11.137
<i>Question 61: Do you avoid 
thinking about your future?</i>

15:11.137 --> 15:12.637
<i>Yes or no.</i>

15:12.637 --> 15:14.687
How long will this keep going?

15:14.687 --> 15:19.507
<i>Question 62: Do you intend to disobey 
the curfew set by your family?</i>

15:21.367 --> 15:22.827
<i>Does it annoy you that your sister</i>

15:22.827 --> 15:25.287
<i>acts like your guardian 
in place of your deceased mother?</i>

15:25.957 --> 15:33.257
<i>Does your mind only feel clear when you 
surrender yourself to intense violence?</i>

15:34.917 --> 15:36.717
You're watching me, aren't you?

15:36.717 --> 15:40.137
Stop hiding and come on out!

15:40.487 --> 15:42.827
<i>How do they know about me?</i>

15:42.827 --> 15:44.977
<i>They even know about my sister and mom.</i>

15:49.727 --> 15:53.847
<i>Do not step away from the phone. 
You called us.</i>

15:53.847 --> 15:56.907
<i>We are doing this 
to give you what you want.</i>

15:57.627 --> 15:59.157
What?

15:59.157 --> 16:02.747
<i>You believe the world is your oyster.</i>

16:03.207 --> 16:06.937
<i>You believe you can do anything.</i>

16:06.937 --> 16:10.627
<i>But you're actually just 
a stupid little virgin.</i>

16:10.627 --> 16:12.957
Shut up, bitch!

16:12.957 --> 16:15.147
Let Amamiya go!

16:15.147 --> 16:17.847
I'm Yoshina Ageha from Shira High!

16:17.847 --> 16:20.637
Secret society, my ass! 
You're just a bunch of kidnappers!

16:22.127 --> 16:26.117
<i>Final question: 
Do you want to go to Psyren?</i>

16:26.117 --> 16:27.397
<i>Yes or no.</i>

16:27.397 --> 16:29.267
Are you making fun of me?

16:32.917 --> 16:39.167
You'll see. I'll find you 
my own way, Psyren!

16:44.867 --> 16:47.057
What are they doing?

16:48.707 --> 16:52.037
Usui-san, this is definitely the place.

16:52.037 --> 16:55.157
He called last night 
at 1AM from this phone.

16:55.157 --> 16:56.677
I can see him.

16:57.247 --> 17:01.437
He's a child. A high school boy 
using this phone.

17:01.437 --> 17:03.427
He looks real dim.

17:04.047 --> 17:05.757
What's this?

17:05.757 --> 17:07.767
<i>Shut up, bitch!</i>

17:07.767 --> 17:10.137
<i>I'm Yoshina Ageha from Shira High!</i>

17:11.927 --> 17:12.937
I see.

17:13.447 --> 17:14.807
Let's go, Miyake.

17:17.177 --> 17:21.117
We'll show him what happens 
when amateurs call Psyren.

17:21.117 --> 17:22.947
<b>Shirataki High School</b>

17:24.167 --> 17:26.287
We're with the police.

17:26.887 --> 17:28.577
Did one of our students do something?

17:28.577 --> 17:33.207
Not at all. We just have 
a few questions for one of them.

17:33.467 --> 17:35.417
Do you have a photo roster?

17:38.547 --> 17:43.217
<i>If I can't find Psyren using that card, 
what should I do?</i>

17:43.217 --> 17:45.517
<i>Yoshina Ageha of class 1-C.</i>

17:45.517 --> 17:47.607
<i>Come to the faculty office immediately.</i>

17:47.927 --> 17:49.687
What'd you do now?

17:49.687 --> 17:53.517
<i>Yoshina Ageha, come to 
the faculty office now!</i>

17:53.517 --> 17:58.407
Did they find out about me 
grilling meat on the principal's car?

17:58.407 --> 17:59.917
What the hell have you been doing?

17:59.917 --> 18:00.727
Ageha!

18:01.147 --> 18:03.527
There are cops at the faculty office.

18:03.527 --> 18:04.527
Cops?

18:04.527 --> 18:06.617
But they're impostors.

18:06.937 --> 18:10.857
I've seen my share of police notebooks 
ever since I was a kid.

18:10.857 --> 18:13.467
Of course you have. 
Your dad's a high-ranking cop.

18:13.467 --> 18:16.317
Later, guys. I'm getting out of here.

18:16.317 --> 18:17.547
Wait, Ageha.

18:17.887 --> 18:19.877
<i>The guy from the occult club was right.</i>

18:19.877 --> 18:22.877
<i>Danger comes to those 
who investigate Psyren.</i>

18:22.877 --> 18:24.847
<i>But how did they learn about me?</i>

18:29.847 --> 18:33.187
Where do you think you're going, 
Yoshina Ageha-kun?

18:33.627 --> 18:36.517
And what do a couple of 
fake cops want with me?

18:36.517 --> 18:39.867
If you already know who we are, 
then that makes this simple.

18:39.867 --> 18:42.797
Give us your Psyren card.

18:42.797 --> 18:44.487
We'd rather not have to hurt you.

18:44.777 --> 18:46.867
I don't know what you're talking about.

18:46.867 --> 18:48.307
Don't play dumb.

18:48.307 --> 18:52.327
We're monitoring all the payphone lines.

18:53.207 --> 18:56.337
Are you the shady guys 
trying to collect the money?

18:56.337 --> 18:57.877
Money?

18:58.697 --> 19:01.797
You don't know what that card 
is really worth, boy.

19:09.167 --> 19:13.817
You have no idea what Psyren really means.

19:13.817 --> 19:15.987
Psyren is the great will.

19:15.987 --> 19:18.107
A world unto itself.

19:18.107 --> 19:20.067
<i>This guy's crazy.</i>

19:20.067 --> 19:23.817
Search his clothes before 
the Psyren card awakens.

19:25.327 --> 19:26.027
Miyake!

19:31.237 --> 19:33.367
He's getting away! After him!

19:37.627 --> 19:39.547
Damn it! My eyes!

19:39.547 --> 19:42.467
Find him! The card is awakening!

19:43.857 --> 19:46.417
<i>A phone? It's not mine.</i>

19:46.417 --> 19:47.467
<i>Where's it coming from?</i>

19:48.217 --> 19:50.847
<i>Right, my phone! I can call for help!</i>

19:51.567 --> 19:53.197
Hiro, Saka!

19:53.647 --> 19:54.937
Damn, I can't see!

19:56.767 --> 19:59.227
Shut up! What is this, damn it?

20:00.567 --> 20:01.777
Found you!

20:02.937 --> 20:04.997
Someone! Anyone!

20:04.997 --> 20:06.607
Answer the phone, please!

20:21.747 --> 20:25.127
What? What is this?

20:25.127 --> 20:26.407
What's going on?

20:26.817 --> 20:29.117
Am I dreaming?

20:29.117 --> 20:30.467
Is someone there?

20:30.867 --> 20:33.137
H-Help me!

20:33.137 --> 20:34.347
Are you okay?

20:39.227 --> 20:40.257
What?

20:44.987 --> 20:46.567
Is he dead?

20:49.527 --> 20:50.777
Get down, Yoshina!

20:58.197 --> 20:59.857
A-Amamiya!

20:59.857 --> 21:03.177
What are you doing here?

21:03.177 --> 21:07.077
What? Uh, I'm not sure.

21:07.077 --> 21:09.847
You called Psyren, didn't you?

21:09.847 --> 21:12.137
You used the card, didn't you?

21:12.137 --> 21:14.717
I did! I can't breathe!

21:14.717 --> 21:20.517
You idiot! You have no idea 
what you've done! Why?

21:20.777 --> 21:23.227
Y-You asked me to help you.

21:24.767 --> 21:29.237
I heard you ask for help.

21:38.697 --> 21:40.747
You're such an idiot.

21:41.527 --> 21:46.497
<i>I thought I was placing a call back then, 
but it seems I answered one instead.</i>

21:46.997 --> 21:49.527
<i>The mysterious Nemesis Q's call.</i>

21:50.137 --> 21:53.677
<i>This was the start of my deadly game.</i>

21:54.957 --> 21:56.087
<i>Psyren...</i>

21:56.867 --> 21:58.797
<i>A world unto itself.</i>

21:59.707 --> 22:02.547
<i>Worlds will be connected.</i>

23:35.147 --> 23:40.027
<b>Episode 2







Tavoo</b>
